  "remarks": "Vladimir Lepin is the general designer of JSC Kalashnikov Concern, a company listed by the Union and a Russian developer and manufacturer of military equipment, including personal rifles, missiles and vehicles. JSC Kalashnikov Concern is directly controlled by Rostec. Vikhr-1 guided aircraft missiles and AK-12 assault rifles produced by Kalashnikov Concern are used by the Russian Armed Forces during Russia’s war of aggression against Ukraine.",
